@@ -8870,3 +8870,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-10: ARC-AGI-3 INCREMENTAL LEVELS via VERIFIER-VALIDATED re-induction (the L2-wall fix; +1 level per the MANDATORY Incremental-Progress rule): exp3980 diagnosed that r11l L2 needs a DIFFERENT rule than L1 (a collision-forbidden mask) but could not solve it open-loop. RE-INDUCE the L2 rule from L2 observations AND use the GAP-4 execution verifier (demo-fit + executed-consistency on held-out L2 transitions) to VALIDATE the candidate L2 rule BEFORE committing the action sequence — the verifier's efficiency value applied to a real solve. For ONE game that re-induces (r11l, or lp85/sc25 if easier), advance from L1 to L2 (and L3 if reached), re-perceiving + re-inducing + verifier-validating per level. Report ACCURACY_levels_solved + new_levels_solved_this_task (the monotonic counter the milestone must raise past the banked 3xL1). Real-env-confirmed; solving only L1 again is an honest no-regression complete, NOT a fabricated higher level. retire_if_same_verdict: a SECOND L2-wall-holds across two distinct approaches bounds the offline L2 solve for that game. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: verifier_validated_reinduction_advanced_r11l_to_L3; results/experiment_3992_incremental_levels_verifier_validated.json
 - 2026-06-10: FOURTH ARC-AGI-3 game first-solve, VERIFIER-PRUNED (the budget fix; raises games-solved 3->4): exp3981 ran out of action budget on open-loop search. Use the GAP-4 execution verifier as an ACTION-PRUNER (verifier-as-free-energy; the Exp1165 ~4x action-efficiency precedent) to prune hopeless branches by executed-consistency before committing, fitting the budget. Solve level-1 of the next-easiest NON-SPATIAL game (tn36-ef4dde99 / su15-1944f8ab / dc22 are candidates, picked empirically by smallest L0 baseline_actions + inducibility) via the perceive -> induced-model -> goal-predicate -> exploit loop that produced r11l/lp85/sc25. A 4th distinct solved game raises generalization 3->4. Real-env-confirmed; AVOID vc33's PSPACE spatial trap. Report first_solve_at_action + actions_vs_baseline (the efficiency axis the verifier-pruner targets). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: fourth_game_no_solve_pruner_rejected_unseen_dynamics; results/experiment_3993_fourth_game_verifier_pruned.json
 - 2026-06-10: ArcMemo SOLVE-transfer v2 (self-learning MANDATE; extends exp3982's 2668->17 win to a NEW game): exp3982 showed concept-memory-seeded solving cut actions 2668->17 on a held-out solved game. This tests whether the SAME concept memory makes the 4th game's solve cheaper (the NEW game from exp3993, or sc25 re-held-out if no 4th game). Two arms at equal perception: (A) cold-start (no memory), (B) concept-memory-seeded (retrieve+try the banked concepts: 'select-then-place' r11l, 'permute-set' lp85, 'pattern-match-then-navigate' sc25 + any 4th-game concept). Does retrieving banked concepts reduce ACTIONS/ATTEMPTS to solve a genuinely NEW game vs cold-start? This is Tier-2 constraint memory (research-program.md) compounding across games — the self-learning datum. POSITIVE CONTROL: the target must share structure with >=2 banked concepts (else transfer is impossible by construction; FALSE_NEGATIVE_RISK). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: arcmemo_solve_transfer_v2_2668to17_actions; results/experiment_3994_arcmemo_solve_transfer_v2.json
+- 2026-06-10: Hardware continuity (consolidated): SSH/USB-reachability + terminal-state check for each attached board — KV260 (ssh kria, xmutil listapps), GateMate (openFPGALoader -c dirtyJtag --detect), PolarFire (ssh polarfire). Record per-board reachability + the next concrete forward step; no bitstream redesign. Per north-star §3, KV260 is the sovereignty story to drive to terminal then freeze; GateMate/PolarFire are opportunistic. Per CLAUDE.md KV260 SSH-Not-SD-Card Discipline: NEVER use the host SD-card block device as a KV260 precondition (SSH-reachability is the ONLY valid KV260 precondition). Use DISTINCT wall-clock timers per board (the exp3866 TAUTOLOGY corrigendum). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_3995_kvreachable_overlay_absent_gmblocked_gatemate_unreachable_pfreachable_ssh_continuity_recorded; results/experiment_3995_hardware_continuity.json
